rs. You also can grab a pack for modifying your own car.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/13eca0cd0591e7d65f344ee9f59b331e.poster.avif?t=1747650530\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/13eca0cd0591e7d65f344ee9f59b331e.webm?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/13eca0cd0591e7d65f344ee9f59b331e.mp4?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Car Showcase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your best work in an eye-catching showcase area! Here, you can display your most impressive custom-built mini cars for customers to buy. For each masterpiece you can set your own price based on the cars performance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/bda74f78c5e534027d1cb5858c850b4d.poster.avif?t=1747650530\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/bda74f78c5e534027d1cb5858c850b4d.webm?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/bda74f78c5e534027d1cb5858c850b4d.mp4?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Drive Your Car</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience test drive your custom-built mini cars on a race track! This feature allows you to feel the performance of your custom-built cars firsthand. Whether it's testing speed, handling, or unique upgrades, the race track provides an exciting way to showcase the quality and capability of your custom-built mini cars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/81f879f1a9cfc9707e7c9e5a967e4842.poster.avif?t=1747650530\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/81f879f1a9cfc9707e7c9e5a967e4842.webm?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/extras/81f879f1a9cfc9707e7c9e5a967e4842.mp4?t=1747650530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Racer Car Shop Simulator offers creativity making it an ideal haven for mini car enthusiasts. Start today and transform your shop into the ultimate destination for customers!</p>","developers":["Bewolba Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294630/85f9a9dd5f35729c16f05a434ba6940f5c67dc24/header.jpg?t=1747650530","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3294630/476456470/855ca10119344846ac1dcf4e92fabb2e66107aa7/1750976576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746796704","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3294630/476456470/855ca10119344846ac1dcf4e92fabb2e66107aa7/1750976576/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746796704","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co